<title>USA: Korea Fund files for rights offering.</title>
<headline>Korea Fund files for rights offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Fund Inc said on Friday that it has filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a rights offering to raise about $160 million.</p>
<p>The fund has not yet determined the terms of the proposed rights, said the fund, which invests in Korean securities.</p>
<p>Dealer manager for the offering will be Smith Barney Inc and the offering will be completed during April 1997, the fund said.</p>
</text>
